    "chunk_text": "Every single day, an average of over 3000 users leave their digital footprint on FinnAxia, a powerful testament to its adoption, reliability and value.\n\nThe platform enables straight-through processing across LankaPay payment rails, including CEFT, SLIPS and RTGS and facilitates LPOPP electronic bill payments for ASYCUDA, EPF and SLPA.\n\nHNB Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer Damith Pallewatte said, \u201cOver the past five years, our partnership with Nucleus Software has helped strengthen HNB\u2019s position as a leader in transaction banking in Sri Lanka. FinnAxia has enabled us to deliver a modern, digital-first experience for our corporate customers while enhancing operational agility, supporting growth and driving innovation. As customer expectations continue to evolve, we remain committed to investing in capabilities that create long-term value for our clients and the wider economy.\u201d\n\nNucleus Software Chief Executive Officer and Executive Director Parag Bhise said, \u201cWe are proud to celebrate this milestone with HNB. The success of this partnership reflects a shared vision, strong execution and a commitment to delivering meaningful outcomes for customers. Over the past five years, HNB has demonstrated how the right combination of technology, leadership and agility can transform transaction banking. We look forward to continuing this journey and helping HNB unlock new opportunities for growth, innovation and customer excellence.\u201d\n\nThe implementation was recognised with the Silver award for Best Managed Project at Project Management Excellence Awards 2023, reflecting the scale, complexity and impact of the transformation."
