    "chunk_size_bytes": 726,
    "chunk_text": "People\u2019s Bank relocates Rajina Junction Service Centre\n\nThe People\u2019s Bank Rajina Junction Service Centre was ceremoniously opened at its new and upgraded premises recently.\n\nThe relocated service centre, operating under the People\u2019s Bank Thambuttegama branch, now offers the customers in the\u00a0 area enhanced access to the latest digital banking products, facilities and services.\n\nThe opening ceremony was attended by Regional Manager Anuradhapura Tissa Tennakoon, Assistant Regional Managers I.S. Kirindegedara, S.P.K. Ekanayake and T.M.M.H. Thennakoon, Thambuttegama Branch Manager S. Akilan and Rajina Junction Service Centre Manager B.M.A.S. Bandara, together with the members of the bank staff and valued customers."
