    "chunk_size_bytes": 1091,
    "chunk_text": "Backed by decades of capital market expertise, First Capital Asset Management (FCAM) has established a strong reputation in Sri Lanka\u2019s wealth management landscape through its strategic approach to fixed income investing and active portfolio management capabilities. The fund is managed by the experienced FCAM team and guided by a seasoned investment committee with extensive expertise across fixed income markets and macroeconomic trends.\n\nFirst Capital Holdings continues to play a pioneering role in Sri Lanka\u2019s capital markets sector, offering a comprehensive range of investment, wealth management and advisory solutions.\n\nThe FCFIF also offers a fully digital onboarding experience, enabling the investors to seamlessly access the fund through a 100 percent paperless investment process, further enhancing accessibility and convenience.\n\nThrough the enhancement of this product, FCAM continues to strengthen its customer-centric investment offering by delivering accessible, performance-driven financial solutions aligned with the evolving investor needs and market opportunities."
