    "md5": "15cab22e525a68740763f6036ba6ae08",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1720,
    "chunk_text": "Delmege Consumer partners Daraz to bring its goods to your doorstep\n\nDaraz Head - Retail and Supply Chain Dushan Kahandagamage (left), with Delmege Group Head - Marketing Baratha Piyadigama, Delmege Consumer Manager - Marketing Shanaka Rajapaksha,\u00a0and Manager - E- Commerce and Digital Marketing Atheeq Kabeer\n\nDelmege Consumer, the flagship FMCG cluster of the Delmege Group, has evolved into one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most trusted household names, building lasting relationships with communities across the island through a diverse portfolio of quality products that have become an integral part of consumers\u2019 everyday lives for generations.\n\nRenowned for enriching households with Delmege\u2019s own brands, leading local brands, and world-renowned international brands, the company continues to strengthen its presence, reputation, and connection with consumers nationwide.\n\nA key strength of the FMCG cluster lies in the strong and enduring partnerships it has cultivated with suppliers, enabling the company to establish a responsive, time-sensitive, and mutually beneficial distribution network that has made a significant impact across Sri Lanka. Through its extensive reach and customer-focused approach, Delmege Consumer serves retail, wholesale, HoReCa, export, and modern trade channels, supported by flexible channel management strategies and winning consumer-centric propositions that cater to evolving market needs.\n\nFurther strengthening its distribution network and expanding its digital footprint, Delmege Consumer has partnered with Daraz, Sri Lanka\u2019s leading e-commerce platform, to offer customers a more convenient, seamless, and accessible way to purchase its extensive range of FMCG products online."
