    "description": "\u201cSuresh is an innocent man suffering for no reason\u201d  \u2013 Manori Sallay",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/hard-talk/Suresh-is-an-innocent-man-suffering-for-no-reason-Manori-Sallay/334-343241",
