    "chunk_size_bytes": 1985,
    "chunk_text": "SLT-MOBITEL launches \u2018Lankakonect\u2019 app to support Sri Lankans overseas\n\nSLT-MOBITEL, in partnership with the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Employment, & Tourism, has officially launched the Lankakonect mobile application\u2014a digital complaint management platform designed for Sri Lankans living and working abroad.\n\nDeveloped for the Ministry\u2019s Consular Affairs Division and the Sri Lanka Bureau of Foreign Employment (SLBFE), the app enables overseas citizens and migrant workers to register, submit, and track grievances in Sinhala, Tamil, and English. Issues covered include employment contract violations, abuse, unpaid wages, and locating loved ones. The platform eliminates long waits and unnecessary travel, allowing complaints to be raised anytime, anywhere\u2014particularly benefiting vulnerable domestic workers who can escalate urgent concerns immediately.\n\nUpon lodging a complaint, officials from SLBFE and the Consular Affairs Division can access the system online and begin resolution processes. Users can track their complaints in real time through the full lifecycle, while management gains a holistic view of progress. The International Labour Organization (ILO) supported the initiative as a Technical Partner, and the project builds on prior digital efforts by the Kuwait Embassy.\n\nThe launch comes as Sri Lankan overseas workers contributed a record USD 8.07 billion in remittances in 2025, underscoring their vital role in the national economy. The app honours these contributions while keeping citizens connected to their motherland.\n\nThrough Lankakonect, SLT-MOBITEL reaffirms its commitment to the government\u2019s vision of a fully digitised Sri Lanka, using technology to serve its people and strengthen ties between embassies and expatriate communities worldwide.\n\nLAKARCADE appointed as national entity member of World Crafts Council\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *"
