    "chunk_text": "Through influential business forums, high-level trade missions, strategic partnerships and impactful networking platforms, the SLTBC has played a pivotal role in strengthening commercial relations while fostering innovation, knowledge exchange and sustainable economic development.\n\nWhile today\u2019s silver jubilee celebration marks a proud milestone in the SLTBC\u2019s journey, it also serves as a launchpad for the next era of Sri Lanka-Thailand economic cooperation. As businesses navigate a rapidly evolving global landscape shaped by digital transformation, artificial intelligence, sustainability and innovation, the SLTBC is poised to play an even greater role in driving cross-border partnerships, investment and trade.\n\nThe silver jubilee celebrations will also pay tribute to the founders, past presidents, executive committee members, corporate partners and stakeholders whose vision, leadership and dedication have shaped the SLTBC into one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most respected bilateral business chambers.\n\nBuilding on a strong legacy of achievement, the SLTBC looks to the future with renewed purpose and ambition, committed to unlocking new opportunities, fostering innovation and creating lasting economic value that will strengthen the partnership between Sri Lanka and Thailand for generations to come. As such, the silver jubilee stands not only as a celebration of the past 25 years but also as a powerful reminder of the limitless opportunities that lie ahead for two nations united by friendship, shared values and a common vision for economic prosperity."
