    "description": "Middle East conflict puts global spotlight on Colombo Port, World Bank tells government",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/Middle-East-conflict-puts-global-spotlight-on-Colombo-Port-World-Bank-tells-government/215-343333",
