    "chunk_text": "World Bank representatives said they were prepared to share international experiences on introducing private sector participation in ports, particularly on engaging with trade unions and implementing employee-friendly reforms that have improved incomes and staff welfare in other countries.\n\nAttention was also drawn to the future restructuring of SriLankan Airlines and the wider aviation sector. The Minister said discussions on these reforms are being carried out with the International Finance Corporation (IFC), with a view to strengthening the country\u2019s aviation industry alongside port sector development."
