    "description": "Print Expo 2026 starts today; to spotlight innovation, sustainability and MSME sector growth",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Print-Expo-2026-starts-today-to-spotlight-innovation-sustainability-and-MSME-sector-growth/34-793504",
    "lang": "en",
