    "chunk_text": "Vance had publicly criticised the attitude of some members of Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu's cabinet towards the deal on Thursday, including Ben-Gvir - telling reporters Israel should \"wake up and smell the reality\".\n\nLebanon was drawn into the war between Israel, the US and Iran shortly after it began, with Hezbollah launching rockets into Israel in retaliation for a strike that killed Iran's supreme leader.\n\nSince then, Lebanese health authorities say more than 3,900 people have been killed in Israeli attacks, among them 366 women and 247 children. It is not clear whether or how many Hezbollah fighters are among them.\n\nIsraeli authorities say at least 30 soldiers and four civilians have been killed on both sides of the border in the same period."
