    "chunk_text": "ICC Chairman meets Dissanayake\n\nColombo, June 19 (Daily Mirror) - A meeting between President Anura Kumara Dissanayake and Mr Jay Shah, Chairman of the International Cricket Council (ICC), was held this afternoon (19) at the Presidential Secretariat.\n\nAccording to the President\u2019s Media Division (PMD), the discussions took place in a cordial atmosphere."
