    "chunk_text": "The Court observed that the petitioners had failed to fully settle the outstanding liabilities despite a formal resolution adopted by the bank on March 26, 2021, authorising parate execution. The judges further held that People\u2019s Bank was entitled to continue with the auction sale of the mortgaged properties to recover the unpaid debt.\n\nDelivering the judgement, Justice Premachandra observed that the impugned resolution had been passed in March 2021, whereas the writ application had been filed only in November 2022, a delay of more than one year and eight months. The judges held that the petitioners had failed to provide a satisfactory explanation for the delay and had effectively slept on their rights."
  },
