    "chunk_text": "Ideal Motors concludes Habarana Abiyogaya 10\n\nIdeal Abiyogaya 10, the 10th phase of the Ideal Abiyogaya community engagement initiative by Ideal Motors, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading automotive brands, concluded recently in Habarana with resounding success.\n\nLaunched in 2015, the Ideal Abiyogaya programme has been held exclusively for the Mahindra Bolero customers and community. The 10th phase extended across the districts of Anuradhapura, Polonnaruwa, Matale and Trincomalee.\u00a0 \u00a0As part of the school\u2011based industrial training programmes under Ideal Abiyogaya, a Mahindra engine and industrial equipment were donated to the technical department of Habarana Maha Vidyalaya. In parallel, the Ideal Singing Abiyogaya identified talented children from schools in the Kekirawa and Hingurakgoda educational zones, creating future opportunities for the most gifted performers.\n\nThe Mahindra Bolero Off\u2011Road Rally, reserved for Mahindra Bolero customers, was another highlight of the event. The celebrations concluded with a free musical concert that drew a large crowd, underscoring the success and popularity of the programme.\u00a0 \u00a0The creator of the Ideal Abiyogaya programme, Ideal Motors Group Founder and Chairman Nalin Welgama shared his thoughts on the journey his company has come so far, the Ideal Abiyogaya programme and Ideal Sewana programmes planned for the future."
  },
