    "chunk_size_bytes": 1720,
    "chunk_text": "SLIIT, Most Loved Private Higher Education Brand in LMD Readers\u2019 Choice Ranking\n\nSLIIT secures the top-spot as the Most Loved Brand in the Higher Education (Private) Category in the LMD Readers\u2019 Choice Most Loved Brands 2026 ranking, reaffirming its strong standing among Sri Lanka\u2019s leading education brands.\n\nThe recognition does more than cement SLIIT\u2019s identity as an industry leader in higher education, it places SLIIT among the country\u2019s preferred brands and reflects the trust, familiarity and positive brand affinity it has built over the years. In a sector where credibility, academic quality and graduate outcomes are central to building public confidence, this recognition marks an important milestone.\n\nThis recognition affirms SLIIT\u2019s commitment to building a secure, excellence-focused environment where students and faculty thrive. The 98 percent employment rate of SLIIT graduates reflects the impact of higher education in shaping Sri Lanka\u2019s future talent pipeline. Students and parents today seek institutions that offer not only academic qualifications but also industry relevance, global exposure, employability and a learning environment that supports long-term personal and professional growth.\n\nSLIIT\u2019s focus on quality teaching, research, innovation, industry engagement and student-centred learning has helped establish the institute as a trusted choice for students preparing to enter an increasingly competitive work force. Forging industry partnerships, launching the first degree in artificial intelligence (AI) in the country and embedding AI as a cross-cutting competency across all degree programmes are pioneering measures SLIIT engages for the benefit of its students."
