    "chunk_text": "SLIIT\u2019s focus on quality teaching, research, innovation, industry engagement and student-centred learning has helped establish the institute as a trusted choice for students preparing to enter an increasingly competitive work force. Forging industry partnerships, launching the first degree in artificial intelligence (AI) in the country and embedding AI as a cross-cutting competency across all degree programmes are pioneering measures SLIIT engages for the benefit of its students.\n\nThis depth of expertise ensures that students are supported by academics who are not only leaders in their disciplines but active contributors to the advancement of knowledge globally.\n\nSLIIT Vice Chancellor and CEO Professor Lalith Gamage said, \u201cBeing recognised as the Most Loved Brand in the Higher Education (Private) Category is a meaningful honour for SLIIT, because it reflects the confidence placed in us by a discerning readership. Higher education is one of the most important decisions a student and their family can make and this recognition encourages us to continue strengthening academic excellence, industry relevance, global partnerships and the overall student experience. At SLIIT, our commitment is to prepare graduates who are not only qualified but also capable, adaptable and ready to contribute meaningfully to Sri Lanka and the wider world.\u201d"
