    "description": "TPA raises land rights, resettlement issues with Australian High Commissioner",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/TPA-raises-land-rights-resettlement-issues-with-Australian-High-Commissioner/108-343457",
    "lang": "en",
