    "md5": "97dd2c17ddf6a70dd5e1921f231debfb",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1403,
    "chunk_text": "Ideal Motors \u2018Ideal Abiyogaya 10\u2019 successfully concludes in Habarana\n\nIdeal Abiyogaya 10\u2019, the 10th phase of the Ideal Abiyogaya Community Engagement initiative by Ideal Motors, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading automotive brands, concluded recently at Habarana with resounding success.\n\nLaunched in 2015, the Ideal Abiyogaya program has been held exclusively for Mahindra Bolero customers and the community. The 10th phase extended across the districts of Anuradhapura, Polonnaruwa, Matale, and Trincomalee.\n\nAs part of the school-based industrial training programs under Ideal Abiyogaya, a Mahindra engine and industrial equipment were donated to the technical department of Habarana Maha Vidyalaya. In parallel, the Ideal Singing Abiyogaya identified talented children from schools in the Kekirawa and Hingurakgoda educational zones, creating future opportunities for the most gifted performers.\n\nThe Mahindra Bolero Off-Road Rally, reserved for Mahindra Bolero customers, was another highlight of the event. The celebrations concluded with a free musical concert that drew a large crowd, underscoring the success and popularity of the program.\n\nThe creator of the Ideal Abiyogaya program, Nalin Welgama, Founder and Chairman, Ideal Motors Group, shared his thoughts on the journey his company has come so far, the Ideal Abiyogaya program, and the \u2018Ideal Sewana\u2019 programs planned for the future."
  },
