    "chunk_text": "Iran closes Strait of Hormuz over ceasefire violations - MEHR\n\n(Reuters) -\u00a0 Iran's top joint military command, \u200bKhatam al-Anbiya Central \u200cHeadquarters, said on Saturday that the Strait \u200bof Hormuz would \u200bbe closed to vessel \u2060traffic, citing \u200balleged violations of a \u200bceasefire agreement by the U.S. and Israel, Iran's \u200bMehr state \u200bnews agency reported.\n\nIt said that \u200cthe \u2060closure was the \"first step\" in response to what it \u200bdescribed \u200bas \u2060breaches of commitments and warned \u200bthat further measures \u200bwould \u2060be taken if \"aggression\" continued."
