    "date_str": "2026-06-22",
    "description": "The two faces of Dubai:  Glitzy high-rises, low-paid workers",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/The-two-faces-of-Dubai-Glitzy-high-rises-low-paid-workers/172-343543",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
