    "chunk_text": "\u200bOperating as a proud extension of Bangalore-based Veepee Graphic Solutions, Veepee Graphics Lanka has established itself as a trusted name synonymous with quality, precision, and technological excellence. The strategic initiative to expand into Sri Lanka was positioned by astute entrepreneur P. Jaichandra. Today, the organisation is further strengthened by its future-ready leadership, with Natasha Jaichandra representing the next generation. As one of the youngest directors in the flexible packaging industry, she brings youthful energy, technical acumen, and a progressive vision that seamlessly blends tradition with modern innovation.\n\n\u200bDemonstrating its relentless pursuit of excellence, the company serves an impressive portfolio of prestigious clientele and has consistently delivered world-class solutions earning recognition across Asia and Europe. This includes honors at the prestigious FPLMA Awards in Australia. The organisation\u2019s success is deeply reflected in the accolades bestowed upon its leadership. Director Nalani Madhushani was recently honoured by PrintWeek Asia in its esteemed Women to Watch segment, receiving the coveted Factory Person of the Year Award as a testament to her visionary leadership and commitment to operational excellence.\n\n\u200bCommenting on the occasion and the company\u2019s continuous commitment to the industry, Director Nalani Madhushani noted the organisation\u2019s dedication to uplifting local standards. \u201cAt Veepee, excellence is not merely a goal, it is a tradition, a responsibility, and a promise that continues to shape the future of print,\u201d she stated. Beyond commercial success, Veepee Graphics Lanka takes immense pride in contributing to the economic progress of Sri Lanka by empowering local businesses to grow, compete, and thrive in a dynamic global marketplace."
