    "chunk_size_bytes": 568,
    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka Army calls for applications for Officer Cadet Courses\n\nColombo, June 22 (Daily Mirror) - The Sri Lanka Army has invited applications for vacancies in the Officer Cadets Short Course (Diploma) and the Lady Officer Cadets Course (Diploma) in the Regular Force.\n\nEligible candidates interested in pursuing a career as commissioned officers in the Army are encouraged to apply.\n\nFurther details, including eligibility criteria, application procedures and course information, are available on the Sri Lanka Army\u2019s official website (https://www.army.lk/officer)."
