    "chunk_text": "UK\u2019s Starmer resigns as prime minister\n\nJune 22 (Daily Mirror) - British Prime Minister Keir Starmer has resigned in a televised statement after coming under mounting pressure from his own Labour Party.\n\nIt follows the decisive by-election win by his rival, Andy Burnham, to claim a parliamentary seat in North West England."
