    "chunk_text": "The strategic initiative to expand into Sri Lanka was positioned by astute entrepreneur P. Jaichandra. Today, the organization is further strengthened by its future-ready leadership, with Natasha Jaichandra representing the next generation. As one of the youngest directors in the flexible packaging industry, she brings youthful energy, technical acumen, and a progressive vision that seamlessly blends tradition with modern innovation.\n\n\u200b\u200bCommenting on the occasion and the company\u2019s continuous commitment to the industry, Director Nalani Madhushani noted the organization\u2019s dedication to uplifting local standards. \u201cAt Veepee, excellence is not merely a goal, it is a tradition, a responsibility, and a promise that continues to shape the future of print,\u201d she stated. Beyond commercial success, Veepee Graphics Lanka takes immense pride in contributing to the economic progress of Sri Lanka by empowering local businesses to grow, compete, and thrive in a dynamic global marketplace."
