    "description": "Salesforce sees Sri Lanka\u2019s growing economy as a prime space for AI -driven enterprise evolution",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Salesforce-sees-Sri-Lankas-growing-economy-as-a-prime-space-for-AI-driven-enterprise-evolution/273-343613",
