    "md5": "1bda6531418ae816ef8081e31aa011e8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1267,
    "chunk_text": "People\u2019s Bank launches 125th Cheque Deposit Kiosk\n\nPeople\u2019s Bank launched its 125th Cheque Deposit Kiosk (CDK) at the Self Banking Unit (SBU) of its Mid City Branch on 22 June, under the patronage of Clive Fonseka, Chief Executive Officer/General Manager of People\u2019s Bank, marking the highest number of Cheque Deposit Kiosks deployed by any commercial bank in Sri Lanka to date.\n\nThe Cheque Deposit Kiosk is designed to provide customers with a seamless and user-friendly experience by enabling cheque deposits without the need of filling deposit slips.\n\nThe launch of the 125th Cheque Deposit Kiosk further strengthens People\u2019s Bank\u2019s position as a leader in digital banking, reinforcing its commitment to delivering innovative banking solutions that enhance customer convenience while supporting the country\u2019s digital transformation.\n\nPeople\u2019s Bank Deputy General Manager (Recoveries) Naleen Pathiranage, Deputy General Manager (Channel Management) Aruni Liyanagunawardana, Assistant General Manager (Centralized Back Office) Shantha Gangabadage, Assistant General Manager (Channel Management) I.K. Indika, Regional Manager (Colombo North) Amitha Sanjeewani, Assistant Regional Managers, Branch Manager, staff, and customers participated in the event."
  },
  {
