    "description": "Forest cover and tribal groups affected: India gives up  critical naval airbase  under environmentalists\u2019 pressure",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Forest-cover-and-tribal-groups-affected-India-gives-up-critical-naval-airbase-under-environmentalists-pressure/172-343629",
    "lang": "en",
