    "date_str": "2026-06-23",
    "description": "Kunming Expo : A gateway to China for Sri Lankan exporters",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Kunming-Expo-A-gateway-to-China-for-Sri-Lankan-exporters/34-793664",
