    "chunk_text": "MPs try to grab mace\n\nColombo, June 23 (Daily Mirror) - Several Opposition MPs including Ajith P. Perera, Dayasiri Jayasekera and a few others tried to grab the mace but were stopped by Sergeant-at-Arms Kushan Jayarane and others who are in charge of Parliamentary security."
