    "chunk_text": "Parliament approves budget proposal to reduce VAT, SSCL threshold\n\nColombo, June 23 (Daily Mirror) - Parliament unanimously approved the proposal to reduce the Value Added Tax (VAT) and the Social Security Contribution Levy (SSCL) from Rs.60 million to Rs.36 million."
