    "description": "SLT-Mobitel mCash enables GovPay for traffic fines and govt. payments",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/SLT-Mobitel-mCash-enables-GovPay-for-traffic-fines-and-govt-payments/273-343722",
