    "description": "British Prime Minister\u2019s resignation Sri Lanka\u2019s choice:  One-party rule,  or Internal Party democracy of political opposition",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/British-Prime-Ministers-resignation-Sri-Lankas-choice-One-party-rule-or-Internal-Party-democracy-of-political-opposition/172-343742",
