    "description": "Will lower oil prices become a lasting economic gain?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Will-lower-oil-prices-become-a-lasting-economic-gain/4-793704",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
