    "description": "CSF and Max Planck Foundation support launch of SL Business and Human Rights Guidelines",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/CSF-and-Max-Planck-Foundation-support-launch-of-SL-Business-and-Human-Rights-Guidelines/56-793717",
