    "chunk_text": "COPF, COPE battle for Committee rooms in Parliament\n\nColombo, June 24 (Daily Mirror) - The Committee on Public Finance (COPF) and the Committee on Public Enterprises (COPE) are in a battle over the sharing of the Committee\u00a0room, it was revealed today.\n\nCOPF Chairman Harsha de Silva told Parliament that work carried out by his committee has come to a standstill as the COPE had wanted the committee room from Tuesday to Friday from morning till evening."
