    "chunk_text": "Dengue fight in full swing\n\nA health worker carries out fogging operations in Colombo on June 24, 2026, as part of dengue control measures conducted under the patronage of Medical Officer of Health Dr. Sasanka Ranasinghe. The programme covered all Public Health Inspector areas under Colombo Municipal Council's Medical Officer of Health Division IV. Pix by Pradeep Pathirana."
