    "description": "Private bus operators seek fare hike from July 1",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Private-bus-operators-seek-fare-hike-from-July-1/108-343875",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
