    "chunk_text": "Government does not accept that an individual can survive with Rs. 17,700 per month: Minister\n\nColombo, June 25 (Daily Mirror) - The government won't accept that an individual can survive with Rs. 17,700 per month as claimed by the Department of Census and Statistics, Deputy Minister Anil Jayantha told Parliament today."
