    "chunk_text": "PTA will be abolished in a few months: President\n\nColombo, June 25 (Daily Mirror) - The Prevention of Terrorism Act (PTA) will be abolished in a few months, President Anura Kumara Dissanayake told Parliament today.\n\nHe said legislation to this effect is being finalised by the Minister of Justice."
