    "md5": "db4cd3f60d5f4e4cb5567a323c729820",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 733,
    "chunk_text": "Teen Arrested at BIA Over Rs.352M Hashish\n\nAn 18-year-old Canadian woman was arrested by Customs officers at Bandaranaike International Airport (BIA), Katunayake, for allegedly attempting to smuggle 35.265 kilograms of hashish into Sri Lanka.\n\nThe drugs, concealed inside two suitcases, have an estimated street value of over Rs.352 million.\n\nShe arrived on Tuesday night aboard an Emirates flight from Toronto via Dubai.\n\nCustoms Narcotics Control Unit officers discovered the contraband during a detailed inspection prompted by suspicious behaviour.\n\nPreliminary investigations are underway, and the suspect along with the seized drugs will be handed over to the Police Narcotics Bureau for further investigations and legal action."
  },
