    "chunk_text": "\u2018Art of Weaving\u2019 show held\n\nWith the aim of developing Sri Lanka\u2019s local and traditional handloom weaving sector and expanding market access both locally and internationally, the Ministry of Industries and Entrepreneurship Development, the Sri Lanka Export Development Board (EDB), and the Department of Textile Industries jointly organised the \u201cArt of Weaving\u201d Fashion Show and the launch of the Handloom Weaving Design Handbook. The event was held at the Sri Lanka Export Development Board auditorium under the patronage of Deputy Minister of Industries and Entrepreneurship Development, Chathuranga Abeysinghe."
