    "chunk_text": "Rohitha Rajapaksa leaves CCIB after five-hour statement\n\nColombo, June 25 (Daily Mirror) - Rohitha Rajapaksa, the son of former President Mahinda Rajapaksa, left the Central Crime Investigation Bureau (CCIB) after nearly five hours, having recorded a statement in connection with an investigation into an investment he had made in an institution located in Mirihana."
