    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka Insurance Life in Anuradhapura to assist Poson pilgrims\n\nSri Lanka Insurance Life will be in Anuradhapura from the 28th to the 30th of June 2026, extending round the clock support to thousands of pilgrims visiting the sacred city to commemorate Poson Poya.\n\nContinuing a programme that has been conducted for more than three decades, Sri Lanka Insurance Life, in collaboration with the Anuradhapura District Secretariat, will operate a special service to assist in locating lost individuals and belongings across key pilgrimage sites.\n\nThe main coordination centre will be located at Pethmaga, supported by four sub centres strategically placed at Ruwanweli Maha Seya, Sinha Kuluna, Mirisavetiya and Thuparama.\n\nAgrithmics powers Goomera Estate digital transformation as landmark first for Sri Lanka\u2019s state-owned plantations\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
