    "md5": "fb777754aa23e9030e17c235d4927f33",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1558,
    "chunk_text": "Prime Residencies forges ahead with Mon Vie construction\n\nPrime Lands Residencies PLC announced that construction is actively underway on Mon Vie, a landmark ultra-luxury residential development located at Thalakotuwa Gardens, Colombo 5.\n\nFeaturing never been seen developments in Sri Lankan residential architecture, including the country\u2019s first-ever cantilevered viewing deck and its first floating rooftop restaurant, the project\u2019s scope reflects its broader ambition to bring a genuinely new kind of living\u00a0experience to Colombo.\n\nConceived under the defining philosophy of \u2018The art of family living, perfected\u2019, Mon Vie is designed for discerning modern families who seek both the refinement of contemporary urban living and the warmth of a genuine home.\n\nRising Ground + 25 floors, with a signature rooftop, Mon Vie will offer an exclusive collection of two-bedroom and three-bedroom luxury apartments, with prices starting from\u00a0Rs.86 million.\n\nMon Vie\u2019s crowning glory will be its floating rooftop restaurant, Sri Lanka\u2019s first of its kind, conceived not only as an amenity for residents but as a gourmet destination of its own right, offering panoramic views of Colombo against a backdrop befitting the city\u2019s most exceptional address in Colombo 5.\n\nPositioned within one of Colombo 5\u2019s most sought-after location in Thalakotuwa Gardens, the residents will also enjoy immediate proximity to the city\u2019s leading international schools, hospitals and key commercial destinations, placing everything that matters within instant reach."
