    "chunk_text": "Positioned within one of Colombo 5\u2019s most sought-after location in Thalakotuwa Gardens, the residents will also enjoy immediate proximity to the city\u2019s leading international schools, hospitals and key commercial destinations, placing everything that matters within instant reach.\n\nWith completion estimated for April 2030, the project represents a significant milestone in Colombo\u2019s evolving residential landscape. An attractive four-year payment plan is also available for the project, offering greater flexibility and convenience for prospective homeowners and investors alike.\n\nCurrently in its pre-launch pricing phase, Mon Vie is not only poised to set a new benchmark for family-centred luxury living in the capital but also break new ground in residential luxury architecture, effectively positioning Prime Lands Residencies among the country\u2019s most esteemed visionaries in real estate development."
