    "chunk_text": "Commenting on the launch, CEO Dilupa Pathirana stated, \u201cAs a company that has consistently pioneered new customer experiences, we continuously look for opportunities to use technology to make life easier for our customers. Internal customer data revealed that takeaway orders placed through our counters account for 21 percent of all transactions, with the customers spending an average of 9.5 minutes waiting for their orders. Having identified this opportunity, we wanted to help reduce waiting times for these busy customers by creating a simpler way to order.\n\nSharing her thoughts on the customer experience benefits of the platform, Brand Head Theekshana Mapatuna stated, \u201cToday\u2019s customers value speed, simplicity and flexibility. Tap Grab Go has been designed to fit naturally into their daily routines, whether they are on their way to work, heading to class or picking up refreshments between commitments. It is about making the Barista experience smoother and more rewarding.\u201d\n\nThe launch marks another milestone in Barista\u2019s ongoing digital transformation journey, reinforcing its commitment to combining innovation with customer-centric thinking. Through Tap Grab Go, the company continues to introduce smarter ways for the customers to engage with the Barista brand while adapting to the evolving needs of modern lifestyles.\n\nThe customers can now download the Tap Grab Go app from Apple App Store and Google Play Store and enjoy a faster way to order from Barista."
