    "description": "Future of finance and accounting  will be built on trust, innovation,  and opportunity: New CIMA President",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Future-of-finance-and-accounting-will-be-built-on-trust-innovation-and-opportunity-New-CIMA-President/34-793825",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
