    "description": "NCQP 2026 showcases national excellence  with 2,000+ delegates and 450+ improvement teams",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/NCQP-2026-showcases-national-excellence-with-2-000-delegates-and-450-improvement-teams/34-793832",
    "lang": "en",
