    "chunk_text": "EV Motor Show 2026\n\nSri Lanka\u2019s largest EV exhibition, the YADEA Colombo EV Motor Show 2026, was launched at the BMICH on Friday (26) and will continue on June 27 and 28, bringing together industry leaders, EV innovators, global brands, technology providers and electric vehicle dealers."
