    "chunk_text": "Govt will control solar power systems by next year: Minister\n\nColombo, June 26 (Daily Mirror) - The government will be able to take control of solar power systems by next year with the fixing of 2,000 modems, Deputy Minister of Power and Energy Akram Ilyas told Parliament today.\n\nHe said the government will be able to shut down the solar system temporarily through these modems."
