    "chunk_text": "\u2018Go Anywhere, Get Anything\u2019: Uber arrives in Sri Lanka\u2019s gem capital\n\nUber, Sri Lanka\u2019s leading ride-hailing and delivery platform, announced the launch of Uber Eats and Uber Rides in Ratnapura, further expanding its footprint across the island. Residents and visitors can now access food, groceries, everyday essentials, and reliable transportation through the Uber app, while local merchants, delivery partners, and drivers gain new opportunities to grow and earn.\n\nWith Uber Eats now live across a broad coverage area in the district, customers can order from iconic local favourites such as XYZ , alongside grocery and retail partners, all delivered at the tap of a button. At the same time, Uber Rides offers residents and visitors a convenient and affordable way to get around entire Ratnapura district through a range of two-, three-, and four-wheel options. Known as Sri Lanka\u2019s gem capital, Ratnapura is home to a vibrant community of entrepreneurs, merchants, and small businesses, making it a natural next step in Uber\u2019s expansion across Sri Lanka.\n\nVarun Wijewardane, Country Manager \u2013 Delivery, Uber Sri Lanka, said: \u201cRatnapura is home to a vibrant community of local businesses and entrepreneurs, and we\u2019re excited to bring Uber Eats to the district. By connecting local merchants with more customers and creating flexible earning opportunities for delivery partners, we hope to make everyday convenience more accessible while supporting local economic growth.\u201d\n\nKaushalya Gunaratne, Country Manager \u2013 Mobility, Uber Sri Lanka, said: \u201cWe\u2019re excited to bring Uber Rides to Ratnapura and make reliable, affordable mobility available to more people across the district. This launch creates new earning opportunities for local drivers while giving residents and visitors access to convenient transportation backed by technology designed to make every trip safer and more seamless.\u201d\n\nJanashakthi Life breaks into Top Five Most Loved Life Insurance Brands in the industry"
