    "chunk_size_bytes": 1229,
    "chunk_text": "BeWAXed expands rapidly across Indian beauty market\n\nBeWAXed Sri Lanka, a homegrown specialized beauty waxing brand founded by award-winning entrepreneur Durga Kenny, is making a bold move into India, with new branches set to open across multiple major metropolitan cities in the coming weeks.\n\nWhile waxing has traditionally been offered as one of many services in general beauty salons, BeWAXed stands apart as the only brand that specializes exclusively in waxing, bringing a dedicated, professional standard to a service that deserves its own spotlight. The brand\u2019s rapid multi-city rollout signals not just an expansion, but a clear ambition to establish BeWAXed as a defining name in India\u2019s fast-growing beauty industry.\n\nFounded in 2013, BeWAXed is a Sri Lankan beauty brand that has built a reputation for quality, innovation, and customer-focused skincare and beauty solutions. From its origins in Sri Lanka, the brand has successfully established a strong presence in the local market and is now making significant strides into India\u2019s rapidly growing beauty industry. Driven by a commitment to excellence and authentic brand values, BeWAXed combines premium products with a deep understanding of consumer needs."
