    "chunk_size_bytes": 1718,
    "chunk_text": "Founded in 2013, BeWAXed is a Sri Lankan beauty brand that has built a reputation for quality, innovation, and customer-focused skincare and beauty solutions. From its origins in Sri Lanka, the brand has successfully established a strong presence in the local market and is now making significant strides into India\u2019s rapidly growing beauty industry. Driven by a commitment to excellence and authentic brand values, BeWAXed combines premium products with a deep understanding of consumer needs.\n\nBeWAXed is known to be the only internationally certified waxing service in Sri Lanka and therefore adheres to the highest of international standards. Each technician at BeWAXed undergoes extensive training in skin health, technique and hygiene.\n\nUnlike general beauty salons where waxing is just one of many services on offer, BeWAXed is the only brand that specializes exclusively in waxing, ensuring every client receives expert, dedicated care. BeWAXed\u2019s own skincare range, Goddess Cosmetics, offers products including both hard and soft waxes, sourced from only the best waxing brands in the industry to ensure consistently superior results.\n\nBeWAXed made history by launching Sri Lanka\u2019s first mobile app dedicated to waxing services. The app, available for both Android and Apple phones, allows users to schedule appointments instantly at a branch and time convenient to them and also allows them to choose their trusted waxing technician. It also provides a range of services, including appointment reminders, tips for new and seasoned waxers, updates on the latest brand developments, and offers, discounts and loyalty rewards for frequent users. Users can also reschedule or cancel appointments with ease."
