    "description": "Why Countries Are Banning Children from Social Media and What It Means for Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/news-features/Why-Countries-Are-Banning-Children-from-Social-Media-and-What-It-Means-for-Sri-Lanka/131-344046",
