    "description": "Has Iran emerged stronger after the war? Assessing its regional power status",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Has-Iran-emerged-stronger-after-the-war-Assessing-its-regional-power-status/4-793895",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
