    "chunk_text": "Suresh Sallay transferred to cardiology unit\n\nColombo, June 27 (Daily Mirror) - Former Director of the State Intelligence Service (SIS) Suresh Sallay has been transferred to the Cardiology Unit of the Colombo National Hospital.\n\nHis lawyer said that Sallay was admitted for treatment due to a heart-related condition."
