    "description": "Focus on developing the Coconut and Food & Beverage export industries into a USD 3 billion economy within the next two years",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/focus-on-developing-the-coconut-and-food-beverage-export-industries-into-a-usd-3-billion-economy-within-the-next-two-years/",
