    "chunk_size_bytes": 564,
    "chunk_text": "Dr. Chandika Epitakaduwa elected new GMOA president\n\nColombo, June 27 (Daily Mirror) - Dr. Chandika Epitakaduwa has been elected as the new President of the Government Medical Officers\u2019 Association (GMOA) for the 2026/27 term.\n\nThe Annual General Meeting of the Association was held today (27), where Dr. Epitakaduwa was elected to the position.\n\nMeanwhile, Dr. Bandara Warakagoda has been elected as the new General Secretary of the GMOA.\n\nThe Executive Board and Central Committee of the Association for the 2026/27 period were also elected during the meeting."
