    "chunk_text": "International Dhamma programme on \u2019Kamma\u2019 to be held on Poson Poya Day\n\nColombo, June 28 (Daily Mirror) - An international Dhamma programme titled \"Kamma\" will be held online on Poson Full Moon Poya Day, June 29, with the sermon to be delivered by the Venerable Henepola Gunaratana Mahathera.\n\nThe programme will take place via Zoom from 6.00 p.m. (Colombo time) and is open to participants from around the world.\n\nThose wishing to attend are required to register in advance through the designated Zoom registration link - https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/r70kBuxqRGy4NwREO66OnQ\n\nFollowing registration, participants will receive a confirmation email containing details on how to join the online session."
