    "chunk_text": "HNB Legacy Open returns for third edition\n\nHNB PLC\u2019s Private Banking division will host its third edition of the HNB Legacy Open at the Nuwara Eliya Golf Club on 21st and 22nd August, with InQube Global PVT LTD confirmed as the tournament\u2019s Official Performance Apparel Partner. Now in its third consecutive year, the HNB Legacy Open has established itself as a signature annual fixture for the bank\u2019s Private Banking clients, combining competitive golf with the curated hospitality that has defined the event since its inaugural edition in 2024.\n\nThe tournament was launched following HNB\u2019s long-standing association with the Millennium Trophy at the Royal Colombo Golf Club, marking the bank\u2019s move toward independently hosting a Private Banking event of this scale. Each edition has built on the last, and the 2026 edition introduces InQube\u2019s performance apparel expertise onto the course for the first time, with the company designing and supplying performance wear for the participants.\n\n\u201cHNB Private Banking is built on the quality of the relationships we keep, and the Legacy Open is an extension of that philosophy. The partners we bring into this tournament say something about the standard we hold ourselves to. InQube has built a globally credible performance apparel operation from Sri Lanka, and that is exactly the kind of partner we want alongside us in this space.\u201d\n\nJanashakthi Life breaks into top five most loved life insurance brands\n\nPayMedia marks 12 years of powering Sri Lanka\u2019s Fintech future\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
