    "chunk_size_bytes": 1301,
    "chunk_text": "Pure nostalgia magic\n\n\u2018Rhythm of 70s \u2013 Legends Revisited\u2019 went live at The Arena at Pickering Casino Resort, Scarborough, on Saturday, June 20, 2026.\n\nAnd this is the lineup that lit up the stage: Annesley Malawana, Corrine Almeida, Indrani Perera and Pavan Malawarachchi, backed by the CAN Naada band.\n\nThe show was billed as \u201cstepping back into the golden era of Sri Lankan music\u201d.\n\nThe whole idea was to recreate the magic of those iconic \u201970s melodies that shaped a generation. Think timeless hits, unforgettable rhythms, and that spirit of the golden era.\n\nWhether people grew up on those songs, or just love timeless music, it promised a memorable evening of nostalgia, culture, and live entertainment and it turned out to be just that, with the veteran Annesley Malawana leading the way, with a mesmerising performance\n\nThey say the auditorium was full of people singing along and reliving their youth.\n\nWith graceful stage presence and nostalgic emotion, the songs carried the audience back to a golden era of Sri Lankan music \u2014 where melody, poetry, and rhythm blended into pure magic.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
