    "md5": "67575c049535403bc7c86e331ebe931e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1990,
    "chunk_text": "The ceremonial groundbreaking was officially carried out by distinguished invitees together with the Chairman, and the Management of Home Lands Group, symbolically marking the commencement of construction of Central Park Boulevard Port City Colombo. Beyond breaking ground, the ceremony ushered in a new era for Sri Lanka\u2019s real estate sector and the beginning of what is set to become The Indian Ocean\u2019s Next Wonder.\n\nThe landmark development will feature an exceptional collection of luxury residences, including deluxe apartments, sky villas, penthouses, andEmerald Mansions, complemented by an extensive array of world-class amenities designed to deliver an elevated lifestyle unlike anything previously experienced in Sri Lanka.\n\nThe groundbreaking follows an extraordinary period of momentum for Home Lands. Earlier this month, the company successfully hosted the Grand Launch Weekend of Central Park Boulevard, widely recognised as Sri Lanka\u2019s largest real estate launch event. The three-day series of events attracted investors, prospective homeowners, business leaders, and industry stakeholders from across Sri Lanka and overseas. This was followed by the opening of the Central Park Boulevard Sales Gallery at Port City Colombo, where invitees were given an immersive preview of the development, reinforcing the overwhelming market response and setting the stage for the next chapter of this landmark development.\n\nTogether, these milestones reflect not only the strong market confidence in Central Park Boulevard but also Home Lands\u2019 financial strength and capability to independently undertake and deliver a development of this scale and value, further reinforcing its position as Sri Lanka\u2019s market leader.\n\nConstruction of Central Park Boulevard is scheduled for completion within 40 months. This ambitious timeline reflects Home Lands\u2019 strength as a fully integrated developer with an exceptional track record of delivering high-quality developments on schedule."
  },
