    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Zydus-Lifesciences-and-Sunshine-Healthcare-announce-JV-to-strengthen-pharma-manufacturing-in-Sri-Lanka/273-344192",
    "lang": "en",
