    "chunk_text": "Zydus Lifesciences Ltd brings extensive capabilities across formulations, APIs, medical technology, diagnostics, animal healthcare and consumer wellness.It\u2019s global healthcare expertise and manufacturing excellencewill play a key role in establishing and scaling the facility.\n\nShyam Sathasivam, Group CEO Sunshine Holdings PLC said, \u201cThis partnership is a strategic investment in Sri Lanka\u2019s healthcare security and industrial growth. Together with Zydus, we aim to enhance local pharmaceutical manufacturing, create skilled employment, and improve access to essential medicines for Sri Lankan consumers.\u201d\n\nThe project will operate under the oversight of the Board of Investment,with the Ministry of Health and the National Medicines Regulatory Authority as key stakeholders All products will comply with NMRA regulations and applicable pricing frameworks."
