    "date_str": "2026-06-29",
    "description": "Geopolitical significance of  Bangladeshi PM\u2019s visit to China",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Geopolitical-significance-of-Bangladeshi-PMs-visit-to-China/172-344201",
