    "description": "Renowned environmental architect Sunela to headline Dilmah Conservation\u2019s Grey2Green masterclass",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Renowned-environmental-architect-Sunela-to-headline-Dilmah-Conservation-s-Grey2Green-masterclass/34-793937",
