    "chunk_text": "Beyond Rotary Dr. Athukorala has an outstanding 21-year career in British multinationals Reckitt Benckiser, Unilever, and DiverseyLever. His area of expertise is in building brands, expanding markets. \u201cThese same skills became a defining factor in his Rotary success,\u201d said Governor Delvin Perera who is a banker by profession.\n\nDr. Athukorala holds a unique distinction for serving Sri Lanka as Chairman of both the Sri Lanka Export Development Board and Sri Lanka Tourism, two institutions that play a pivotal role in connecting Sri Lanka with global markets. He also served with the United Nations (UNOPS) for Sri Lanka and Maldives, during a period in which the organisation secured global recognition for project excellence. An alumnus of Harvard University he currently serves as Vice Chairman of the World Rural Tourism Organisation based in Luncuun China, CEO of a AI based brand mapping Indian company Clootrack Software Labs, Director of Asia Pacific Institute of Information Technology (APIIT) and Lotus Hydro Power PLC\u00a0 just to name a few.\n\n\u201cSri Lanka must become a $ 200 billion economy whilst focussing on poverty eradication and each of us must do our duty,\u201d said Dr. Athukorala."
