    "description": "Will Esala Perahera 2026 Begin The End Of Elephant Cruelty In Sri Lanka?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/will-esala-perahera-2026-begin-the-end-of-elephant-cruelty-in-sri-lanka/",
    "lang": "en",
