    "chunk_text": "Suspect arrested with five unregistered high-capacity motorbikes\n\nColombo, June 30 (Daily Mirror) - A 25-year-old suspect has been arrested for possessing five unregistered high-capacity motorbikes during a raid carried out by officers of the Homagama Divisional Crime Investigation Unit.\n\nPolice said the arrest was made following a tip-off in Hokandara, Athurugiriya.\n\nDuring the operation, officers seized five high-capacity motorcycles and two fake number plates that had been affixed to two of the vehicles.\n\nThe suspect and the seized motorbikes were handed over to the Athurugiriya Police for further investigations.\n\nThe suspect is a resident of Hokandara, and Athurugiriya Police are continuing investigations into the incident."
