    "description": "SL to position itself as a regional hub for artificial intelligence infrastructure",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/SL-to-position-itself-as-a-regional-hub-for-artificial-intelligence-infrastructure/273-344292",
    "lang": "en",
