    "description": "Food and energy costs push Sri Lanka inflation to 6.8% in June",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Food-and-energy-costs-push-Sri-Lanka-inflation-to-6-8-in-June/273-344295",
    "lang": "en",
