    "description": "Nordic investors channel US$ 35mn into Sri Lanka\u2019s MSME sector via LB Finance",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Nordic-investors-channel-US-35mn-into-Sri-Lankas-MSME-sector-via-LB-Finance/273-344296",
    "lang": "en",
